# Generated at build time: CMake runs engine/tests/gen_abi_entries.py before
# compiling the ABI conformance test. Do not commit it - a stale copy compiled
# into that test is exactly what leaving git was meant to prevent. Regenerate
# by hand with `python tests/gen_abi_entries.py` from engine/.
engine/tests/abi_entries.inc
